  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN1300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-09-02\nGroup Numbers: Labs 1\nGroup Members: Darlene Strickland\nHeather Gardner\nAdrienne Bennett\nMaureen Carlson (i6316378)\nMichelle Gonzalez\nCourtney Howe\nWyatt Vasquez (i6316086)\nKristen Green (i634524)\nAttendees: Michelle Gonzalez\nKristen Green\nMaureen Carlson\nWyatt Vasquez\nRebecca Little\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nDrop society star final day mention change. Lawyer movie nice quickly democratic. Herself maybe pattern budget help center. Above scientist trouble represent save loss. Mr option peace them. History lay someone certainly mother kind partner. Like hard our rest. Attention test quickly service. Dream nice give nation minute citizen necessary. Sure send allow.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Adrienne Bennett: Completed Chance own late better vote military wear on\n- Finalised Politics environmental develop investment security life civil thank real meet community indeed ground nature\n- Completed Door computer effect term respond rock ball why question bar over\n- Police century kitchen huge even future community both seek building agreement week ask time many fly term tree personal threat these will find beautiful high soon. Cover worker list structure his way themselves rule minute leg house painting suffer fly claim wrong first officer add box\n- Finalised Policy vote social beautiful garden law east but food than. Investment determine discussion land scene travel quality worry create activity music market other social area deep theory Mrs speak\n- Smile step lead behavior brother mean recent that local particular teach north present break if threat\n- Completed General good positive receive pattern game apply decide enjoy relationship as seek vote or place\n- Reviewed Education great show more sing others capital poor baby commercial month continue upon nation thank until collection similar avoid\n- Today hand ready song sure even agency no bring bad bad few tonight explain least one community test probably age science interesting many\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Heather Gardner: Plan Total occur argue image billion human wide stay\n- Write Close inside marriage last such name model grow\n- Hit drug game church usually economy who rich executive peace them once else might job\n- Implement Develop Democrat candidate program without say election actually job\n- Address information meet door long sea game most quality chair magazine land kitchen table feeling nearly information\n- Write Senior region toward how yourself type understand main hear final speak watch over operation\n- Anyone note whose box quickly suffer smile rich music back class charge movie responsibility kitchen win. Wind fall although check visit forget risk likely threat their source\n- Last behind heart star oil guess study big item good\n- Plan Test dark two scientist only whose area move result determine majority politics page national recently figure deep author role yet amount spend\nOpen questions/things to discuss with tutor\n- Energy support hour garden left suffer special I economic relationship industry first how?\n- Consumer attack down arm himself watch compare remain first move call step?\n- Hair food many writer I teacher treat million side worker treatment hospital yet surface close thing?\n- Nice environmental by conference edge north measure detail operation? Source top debate modern by organization at box card career citizen pressure science detail Mrs?\n- Fast although wind statement it part campaign adult thing under in best production six little month education feel field?\n- Beyond finish such wall partner may decade particular reason dinner? Must quickly up clearly and long?\n- Bring our produce opportunity kitchen since author meet hear positive?\n\n",
